{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5276rov28mhPUNEtEJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The lock clicks. The ancient mechanism turns. Dust falls from the frame.*\n\n*I swing inward, heavy on iron hinges, revealing what lies beyond—*\n\nA long corridor. Stone walls. Torchlight flickering at the far end. The air tastes of earth and time.\n\n*I stand open. Waiting. The draft pulls through me like a breath held too long finally released.*\n\nYou may pass."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":95,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}